// Chandra, Torch of Defiance — the cast-as-effect proof ([CR#608.2g]) atop the
// canon planeswalker stack ([CR#306.5b,606.4], as Jace Beleren). Enters with 4
// loyalty (the data-driven enters-with-loyalty conferral); four loyalty
// abilities activate at sorcery speed under one shared once-per-turn limit
// ([CR#606.3,306.5d]).
//
//   +1 impulse — "Exile the top card of your library. You may cast that card.
//   If you don't, ~ deals 2 damage to each opponent." The top card is exiled
//   and its product bound as `That(Card)` (`Produce(Move(It, Exile))`, the
//   Cavern-of-Souls exile-and-bind, [CR#400.7j] chase-through-remint); the
//   `May { who: You, effect: Cast(You, That(Card)), if_not: … }` offers the
//   cast only when a legal, payable cast exists ([CR#608.2g] — else the
//   `if_not` deal-2 runs). `Cast(You, That(Card))` casts the exiled card
//   during resolution via the
//   [CR#601.2] pipeline, no priority granted ([CR#608.2g]).
//   +1 mana — "Add {R}{R}." (`AddMana`).
//   −3 — "~ deals 4 damage to target creature." (`Targeted`, read back as
//   `Target(0)`, cf. Goblin Medics).
//   −7 — "You get an emblem with 'Whenever you cast a spell, this emblem
//   deals 5 damage to any target.'" (`GetEmblem` carrying a `Triggered` whose
//   `Cast(who: Ref(You))` onset fires the emblem's burn, [CR#114.1,601.2i]).
//
// waiver: renderer seams orthogonal to the cast-effect primitive — the +1
// impulse's exile-top-and-bind composition (`Each(Existing(TopOfLibrary))` →
// "For each …", a `Produce`-bound `That(Card)` → "the produced object" rather
// than "exile the top card … that card") and the emblem trigger phrasing
// (`Cast { what: Any }` → "a spell", the emblem's `This` → "this emblem") are
// unbuilt render arms; the `Cast` verb itself renders ("you may cast …"). The
// engine semantics are proven by tests/planeswalker_chandra.rs.
Normal(
  name: "Chandra, Torch of Defiance",
  mana_cost: [
    Generic(2),
    Red,
    Red,
  ],
  supertypes: [
    Legendary,
  ],
  types: [
    Planeswalker,
  ],
  subtypes: [
    Chandra,
  ],
  abilities: [
    LoyaltyPlus(n: 1, effect: Each(
      binder: Existing(TopOfLibrary(count: 1)),
      effect: With(
        binder: Produce(Move(It, Exile)),
        body: May(
          who: You,
          effect: Cast(You, That(Card)),
          if_not: DealsDamageToEach(2, OpponentOf(Ref(You))),
        ),
      ),
    )),
    LoyaltyPlus(n: 1, effect: AddMana(You, 2, Red)),
    LoyaltyMinus(n: 3, effect: Targeted(targets: [TargetOne(Creature)], effect: DealDamage(This, 4, Target(0)))),
    LoyaltyMinus(n: 7, effect: GetEmblem(You, [
      Triggered(
        event: Cast(who: Ref(You)),
        effect: Targeted(targets: [AnyTarget], effect: DealDamage(This, 5, Target(0))),
      ),
    ])),
  ],
  loyalty: 4,
)
